Package: kalita
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Family budget manager, compatible with X-Cash's Data.mdb
 Kalita is a Windows/Linux/Android rewrite of the abandoned X-Cash 2.1
 (Delphi) family budgeting application. It reads and writes the
 original's Data.mdb (Jet4 / Access 2000) database in place, so files
 stay interchangeable with the original X-Cash.
 .
 This package bundles its own Qt 6 runtime and Java runtime (built by
 jpackage) — it does not depend on, or conflict with, any system Qt or
 JDK installation.
